dsh-tool-session-message README · Manual (local development)：1. Put this package at `<profile>/node_modules/dsh-tool-session-message` (`<profile>` is e.g. `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop`).
2. Add it to the profile's `package.json`:
   ```json
   {
     "dependencies": { "dsh-tool-session-message": "link:<path-to-this-package>" },
     "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": [ "...", "dsh-tool-session-message" ] } }
   }
3. The package ships its own `cordis.patch.yml` with `dsh.bundle.patch`, so the tool is inserted process-wide.
4. Restart DSH (host plugins load at startup).
